Skill-load shells invoke `booping render src/templates/...` with cwd anywhere — the user's repo or
vault. The sandbox cwd holds no `src/` at all, so the render can only succeed by resolving the
relative path against the plugin root; a cwd-resolution regression finds nothing and exits 1.

The rendered text is a live template and is deliberately not asserted: the property under test is
which root the path resolves against, not what that template says today.

-- cmd --
booping render src/templates/skills/playbook.md.j2
-- exit --
0
